      examples: ['Subject-verb: "He don\'t like" → "doesn\'t"', 'Tense: "Yesterday I am hungry" → was', 'Article: "I had a apple" → an', '陷阱: 4 个 unchanged 千万别瞎改, 改了也扣分'],
      pitfall: '识别 unchanged 比改错更重要 — 改错的 unchanged 双扣分',
